{
  "id": "126",
  "title": "Little Ming is Too Lazy",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-06-01",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming is scolded by his mother for not cleaning his room, but as always Little Ming has a clever comeback.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/143/50f05ab9e70eb5d00454cda6037e3a2dcc2c1575.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "小明太懒\n\n    一天，妈妈骂小明：“你怎么那么懒，你看你的房间像猪窝一样，还不赶快打扫……”\n    小明想了想，说：“你有看过猪会打扫的吗？不都是养猪的人打扫猪窝的吗？”\n    妈妈气得说不出话来。",
    "traditional": "小明太懶\n\n    一天，媽媽罵小明：“你怎麼那麼懶，你看你的房間像豬窩一樣，還不趕快打掃……”\n    小明想了想，說：“你有看過豬會打掃的嗎？不都是養豬的人打掃豬窩的嗎？”\n    媽媽氣得說不出話來。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming is Too Lazy"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，妈妈骂小明：",
      "traditional": "一天，媽媽罵小明：",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān mā ma mà xiǎo míng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "“你怎么那么懒，你看你的房间像猪窝一样，还不赶快打扫……”",
      "traditional": "“你怎麼那麼懶，你看你的房間像豬窩一樣，還不趕快打掃……”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ zěn me nà me lǎn nǐ kàn nǐ de fáng jiān xiàng zhū wō yí yàng hái bù gǎn kuài dǎ sǎo",
      "english": "One day Little Ming's was being scolded by his mother:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“How can you be so lazy? Look at your room! It looks like a pigsty and you still won't clean it.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小明想了想，说：",
      "traditional": "小明想了想，說：",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xiǎng le xiǎng shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“你有看过猪会打扫的吗？不都是养猪的人打扫猪窝的吗？”",
      "traditional": "“你有看過豬會打掃的嗎？不都是養豬的人打掃豬窩的嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ yǒu kàn guò zhū huì dǎ sǎo de ma bù dōu shì yǎng zhū de rén dǎ sǎo zhū wō de ma",
      "english": "Little Ming thought for a while and said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Have you ever seen pigs clean? Isn't it always the one who keeps the pig that cleans the pigsty?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "妈妈气得说不出话来。",
      "traditional": "媽媽氣得說不出話來。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma qì de shuō bu chū huà lái",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
